#.  .SH HISTORY
#.  UNIX V7 defines the three routines
#.  .BR sprintf ().
#.  2.11BSD has
#.  .BR vsprintf ().
#.  4.4BSD introduces the functions
#.  .BR snprintf ()
#.  and
#.  .BR vsnprintf ().
#.  FreeBSD also has functions
#.  .BR asprintf ()
#.  and
